#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-scrimmage.rst:45
#: f60bf71a2fb843ea91cf5a9dc3b67847
msgid "Additional SCRIMMAGE Parameters"
msgstr "附加 SCRIMMAGE 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-scrimmage.rst:47
#: 339999d5b71141258b41a6849234967a
msgid ""
"Additional parameters can be passed into SCRIMMAGE using the ``-A`` and "
"``--config`` arguments. These parameters can be used to overwrite the "
"defaults in the SCRIMMAGE mission file such as the motion model, visual "
"model, or terrain."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``-A`` 和 ``--config`` 参数向 SCRIMMAGE 传递额外参数。这些参数可用于覆盖 SCRIMMAGE "
"任务文件中的默认值，例如运动模型、可视化模型或地形。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-scrimmage.rst:55
#: 2920486bf8124691ba71cea3faf64811
msgid ""
"Valid ArduPlane motion models include FixedWing6DOF and JSBSimControl. Valid"
" visual models are zephyr-blue, zephyr-red, and zephyr-green. Currently the "
"only valid copter motion model is Multirotor and the iris visual model. "
"Additional visual and terrain models can be installed using the scrimmage "
"apt repository added during installation."
msgstr ""
"有效的 ArduPlane 运动模型包括 FixedWing6DOF 和 JSBSimControl。有效的可视模型为 zephyr-"
"blue、zephyr-red 和 zephyr-green。目前唯一有效的多旋翼运动模型是 Multirotor，可视模型为 "
"iris。可以使用安装时添加的 scrimmage apt 仓库安装更多可视和地形模型。"
